<!--
  DG-082: HYBRID schedule. StartInterval alone is silenced by launchd during
  idle ("pended nondemand spawn = interval" - 15h overnight freeze measured
  2026-08-27 to 08-28). The 15-minute calendar lattice fires through idle;
  StartInterval stays because an overdue interval fires on wake-from-sleep,
  which a slept-through calendar slot never does; RunAtLoad covers login.
  Hours are EXPLICIT in every entry: derive_job_schedules reads a missing
  Hour as 0, not "every hour". Minutes offset from :00/:15/:30/:45 so a
  guard tick never lands on a capture slot. Contract:
  tests/contract/test_dg082_catchup_guard_ops_scheduler.py
-->
